Privacy-Preserving Diabetes and Heart Disease Prediction system 
using FLWCO aims to accomplish the following objectives: 
1. To collect, preprocess, and clean the diabetes dataset by handling missing values, 
removing inconsistencies, and preparing the data for accurate disease prediction. 
2. To implement multiple machine learning-based classification techniques for 
accurate disease prediction. 
3. To design and implement a Weighted Conglomeration Optimization (WCO) 
mechanism to dynamically assign weights based on model performance. 
4. To evaluate the performance of the proposed model using metrics such as accuracy, 
precision, recall, and F1-score. 
